# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Experiment outputs. The predictions and per-cell summaries are kept: they
# took five days of wall-clock to produce under repeated server culls, so
# "regenerated by running the pipeline" is no longer true in any useful sense,
# and they are the evidence behind every number reported. Traces are not kept
# -- they hold the model's full output and are large.
results/**/traces.jsonl
logs/
*.log

# Model weights
*.pt
*.pth
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.gguf

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Local tool config
.claude/

# Fetched OSM geometry: large, slow to rebuild, regenerated by
# data_generation/fetch_topo_geometry.py. Committed deliberately once complete
# so the server does not have to re-download it.

# The experiment ledger is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the only
# record that survives deleting results/, and it belongs in the repository.
!experiments/ledger.jsonl
results/.run.lock
